  "details": "And by the title I mean that I feel like VRChat integrates their systems (personal mirror, name tags, being able to see players through walls via pointing at them) into worlds without letting worlds ACTUALLY limit the settings at all\n\nSo for example a hide and seek world would be hard to make without having to do a work around, like hiding name tags and personal mirrors.\n\nI feel like it would be great for World developers to be able to have a forced toggle for these settings (like how Roblox lets developers set a forced shift-lock mode) so that they can make their worlds more balanced and immersive.",
